;font-size:12.0pt;\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">) ~ 5. 25.(</span><span style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;font-size:12.0pt;\">일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">) 3</span><span style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;font-size:12.0pt;\">일간 목포종합경기장 일원에서 개최합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:180%;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:180%;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;\">목포의 아이덴티티가 반영된 싱어송라이터 발굴을 위해 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">'</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;\">목포를 노래하다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">' </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;\">음악경연대회가 진행되오니 많은 관심 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:180%;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:180%;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">○ </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;\">프로그램명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: 2025 </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;\">목포뮤직플레이 음악경연대회 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">'</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;\">목포를 노래하다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">'</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:180%;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;font-size:12.0pt;\">    </span><span style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-hansi-font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">○ </span><span style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;font-size:12.0pt;\">접수 기간 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">: 2025. 2. 24.(</span><span style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;font-size:12.0pt;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">) ~ 4. 30.(</span><span style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;font-size:12.0pt;\">수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">)</span></